  "contentHtml": "<p>챗GPT의</p><p><b>&#39;+만들기&#39;&#160;</b> 기능을 이용하여</p><p>일종의 챗봇을 만들어 보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fe6c20f560434a8653aa468ab0a7fc3a6da921e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"569\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fe6c20f560434a8653aa468ab0a7fc3a6da921e\" data-origin-width=\"1173\" data-origin-height=\"594\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그럼 &#39;챗봇&#39;이란 무엇일까요?</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 53.7096%; height: 361px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 361px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 361px;\"><b>(챗봇의 역할)</b><br><br>예를 들어,<br>‘광합성’에 대해 궁금한 점이 있는 학생이 챗봇에게 질문하면,<br><br>챗봇은&#160;학습 도우미 역할을 하면서<br>그 질문에&#160;정확하고 친절하게 1:1로 답변해줍니다.<br><br>이 챗봇은 &#39;광합성에 대해 답변하는 역할&#39;을 하도록<br>미리 프롬프트(지시문)를 입력해 두었기 때문에,<br>학생의 질문에 대해, 챗봇은 해당 주제에 맞춰 대답하게 됩니다.<br><br>또한,<br>여러 명의 학생이 동시에 접속해서 질문하더라도,<br>챗봇은&#160;각 학생과 따로 대화하듯 1:1로 소통하기 때문에<br>각자의 질문에 맞춘 답변을&#160;동시에 줄 수 있습니다.&#160;<br><br><i>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;- 위 내용은 챗GPT와 함께 만들었습니다~ -</i></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>1. 수업진행</b></p><p>생명과학2 &#39;세포호흡&#39; 단원을 모두 마치고,</p><p>세포호흡을 포괄하는 &#39;멋진 한문장 만들기&#39;를&#160; 하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>2. GPT를 활용하여 챗봇 만들기</b> : 멋진 한문장에 대해 피드백해주는 역할</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ffe5d623f451a2509a9cdeda33024b8de71f9d50\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ffe5d623f451a2509a9cdeda33024b8de71f9d50\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"578\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>3. 챗봇을 공유하기</b> : 우측 상단의 &#39;공유하기&#39; 버튼을 누르고, 링크복사하기&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/397353843a680bce0340de814faeeb74772cb7b6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"368\" height=\"76\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/397353843a680bce0340de814faeeb74772cb7b6\" data-origin-width=\"542\" data-origin-height=\"112\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a86e231e9227fb205a192cfb0c8a06f92560e25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"330\" height=\"354\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a86e231e9227fb205a192cfb0c8a06f92560e25\" data-origin-width=\"435\" data-origin-height=\"467\"></div><p><b>4. 링크 주소를 학생들에게 공유하기</b></p><p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"ChatGPT - 당신의 '세포호흡 명언'을 피드백 해드려요~\" data-og-description=\"세포호흡의 과정과 의미를 멋진 한문장으로 만들어주세요~\" data-og-host=\"chatgpt.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo\" data-og-url=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-67f9cb3f44a48191a1eb8a5b051ca1cc-dangsinyi-sepohoheub-myeongeon-eul-pideubaeg-haedeuryeoyo\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">ChatGPT - 당신의 '세포호흡 명언'을 피드백 해드려요~</p><p class=\"og-desc\">세포호흡의 과정과 의미를 멋진 한문장으로 만들어주세요~</p><p class=\"og-host\">chatgpt.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>5. 100명 모두 자신의 명언을 입력하고, 개인별 피드백 받기</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e90eb1c2892fb325cfaf6a2063bd3d0ce355c6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e90eb1c2892fb325cfaf6a2063bd3d0ce355c6\" data-origin-width=\"656\" data-origin-height=\"671\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7eeb2face136732349d3a1c24adad2ec8bda967\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7eeb2face136732349d3a1c24adad2ec8bda967\" data-origin-width=\"632\" data-origin-height=\"641\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02aace57f9657342bea6479a597334d58a011b15\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02aace57f9657342bea6479a597334d58a011b15\" data-origin-width=\"638\" data-origin-height=\"619\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
